🧰 17. Troubleshooting
Check all pods
kubectl get pods -A
Describe pod
kubectl describe pod <pod> -n <namespace>
Logs
kubectl logs <pod> -n <namespace>
Common Issues
Issue	Solution
CrashLoopBackOff	Scale down components
Notebook stuck	Wait for image pull
Page not found	Use CONNECT button
Connection refused	Fix port-forward
🚀 18. Production Notes
Use instead of port-forward:
LoadBalancer (MetalLB)
Ingress + domain
Enable:
HTTPS (cert-manager)
OAuth (Dex)
Storage:
NFS / Ceph / Cloud storage
Avoid in production:
Do NOT permanently scale down components
📌 Final Workflow
Setup Cluster
→ Clone Manifests
→ Install (kustomize loop)
→ Fix Pods
→ Port Forward
→ Login
→ Create Notebook
→ CONNECT
→ Run Code
🎉 DONE

You now have a complete reusable Kubeflow deployment guide
